Rips_SetDefaultReferralFee
├── when the caller is not the owner
│   └── it should revert.
└── when the caller is the owner
    ├── when the fee is greater than FEE_BASE
    │   └── it should revert.
    └── when the fee is valid
        ├── it should update defaultReferralFee.
        └── it should emit a {DefaultReferralFeeUpdated} event.
